{
  "page": 525,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 4767,
      "text": "Do their minds[12] prompt them to say such things, or are they transgressing people?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 525,
      "ruku": 459,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4768,
      "text": "Or do they say, “He has made this [Qur’an] up”? Rather, they are not willing to believe.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 525,
      "ruku": 459,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4769,
      "text": "Then let them produce a discourse like this, if they are truthful[13].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 34,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 525,
      "ruku": 459,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4770,
      "text": "Were they created by none, or were they the creators [of themselves]?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 35,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 525,
      "ruku": 459,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4771,
      "text": "Or did they create the heavens and earth? Rather, they are not certain in faith.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 36,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 525,
      "ruku": 459,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4772,
      "text": "Or do they possess the treasures of your Lord, or do they have full control [of everything]?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 525,
      "ruku": 459,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4773,
      "text": "Or do they have a stairway [to the heaven] by which they eavesdrop? Then let those who eavesdrop produce a compelling proof.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 38,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 525,
      "ruku": 459,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4774,
      "text": "Or does He have daughters while you have sons[14]?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 39,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 525,
      "ruku": 459,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4775,
      "text": "Or are you asking them [O Prophet] for a reward so they are overburdened by debt?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 40,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 525,
      "ruku": 459,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4776,
      "text": "Or do they have [the knowledge of] the unseen so they are writing it down?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 41,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 525,
      "ruku": 459,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4777,
      "text": "Or do they intend a plot [against the Prophet]? But the plot of the disbelievers will rebound against themselves.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 42,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 525,
      "ruku": 459,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4778,
      "text": "Or do they have a god other than Allah? Glory be to Allah far above what they associate with Him.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 43,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 525,
      "ruku": 459,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4779,
      "text": "If they were to see pieces of the sky falling down[15], they would still say, “[This is only] a mass of clouds.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 44,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 525,
      "ruku": 459,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4780,
      "text": "So leave them alone until they encounter their Day in which they will be struck down[16],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 45,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 525,
      "ruku": 459,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4781,
      "text": "the Day their plots will not avail them in the least, nor will they be helped.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 46,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 525,
      "ruku": 459,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4782,
      "text": "And for the wrongdoers, there will be another punishment before that[17], but most of them do not know.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 47,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 525,
      "ruku": 459,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4783,
      "text": "Be patient [O Prophet] with your Lord’s decree, for indeed you are under Our [Watchful] Eyes. And glorify the praises of your Lord when you rise.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 48,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 525,
      "ruku": 459,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4784,
      "text": "And glorify Him at night and when the stars fade away[18].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 49,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 525,
      "ruku": 459,
      "hizbQuarter": 210,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
